    "detailed_description": "In Talker Tales, a roguelike deck-building game, there's no combat, only verbal sparring! <br><br>You will play as a clever debater who leads a quick-witted apprentice, using your mastery of language to \u201cpersuade\u201d rebellious lords and bring peace to the land.<br><br>Each adventure takes you to different regions, where you will encounter new enemies and opportunities. Use various debate skills to overcome challenges and convince your opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Verbal Combat!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every card represents a distinct debating technique and corresponding strategic effect.<br></li><li>Utilize cards creatively to &quot;persuade&quot; opponents in different ways.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work Together with Your Followers!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Temporarily store cards with your followers<br></li><li>Use questioning mechanisms of followers to play cards effectively.<br></li><li>Execute combos through strategies.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Best Defense is Offense!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Silence opponents with quick wits <br></li><li>Break their spirit with crushing insults, <br></li><li>making them unable to argue logically!</li></ul>",
